return {
    [" 每个法术场对应要创建的数量 "] = "The quantity to be created for each spell field.",
    ["%s:\n      我听闻你与星象仪者遭遇了一场苦战。不必过分担忧。在过去的岁月循环中，我已经明白失败与胜利——乃至生存与死亡——都不过是一时的、相对的：它只是你旅途中的一个普通坐标，用来验证你的成长。谨记面对星象仪者的诀窍：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302114\">星象仪者</>\n      对于一位总在路上的旅人来说，我知道让人停下脚步的常常并非挫折本身，而是失去了再次上路的勇气。所幸你并不胆怯于面对更多新冒险，我想下次，我听到的就会是更好的消息。对你这样年轻的非凡者而言，你已经做得很好。\n      如果你需要的话，漫长的时光为我积淀下一些经验，也许对你有用。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s:\n      I heard that you encountered a bitter battle with the Astrolabe User. Do not worry too much. In the cycles of time past, I have come to understand that failure and victory—and even life and death—are merely temporary and relative: they are just ordinary coordinates on your journey, used to verify your growth. Keep in mind the tips for facing the Astrolabe User: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302114\">Astrolabe User</>\n      For a traveler who is always on the road, I know that what makes people stop is often not the setback itself, but the loss of courage to set off again. Fortunately, you are not timid about facing new adventures, and I think next time, the news I hear will be better. For a young Beyonder like you, you have already done very well. \n      If you need it, the long passage of time has accumulated some experience for me that might be useful to you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【今夜琴声温柔】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>受邀回到黑荆棘喝咖啡，却听说老尼尔的人生中，曾有一个淡绿色的春天。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>53级</>后，在任务栏可接取支线任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：金纺线、绑定金镑、展台摆件等"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gentle Piano Music Tonight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Invited back to Blackthorn to have coffee, only to hear that there was once a pale green spring in Old Neil's life.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 53</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Threads, Bound Gold Pounds, display ornaments, etc.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【手心里的太阳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>盲人女孩艾米丽·莫里森用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，却始终无法摸到\"光\"的样子。作为太阳神官，使用圣光垂慕为她召唤光芒，帮她感受光的温暖，倾听她讲述的故事，见证\"光的意义，在于照亮彼此\"。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(776,692)]|-22380;-31065;-1409;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度，冒险勋章，发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sun in the Palm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Stories</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blind girl Emily Morrison touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories, yet she can never touch the appearance of \"light.\" As a Sun Priest, use Holy Light Favor to summon light for her, help her feel the warmth of light, listen to the stories she tells, and witness that \"the meaning of light lies in illuminating each other.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Promote to Sequence 7 and head to {Location:[Tingen(776,692)]|-22380;-31065;-1409;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medals, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【美梦成真】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我和你在一起，就是“最佳搭档”。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成支线剧情《美梦成真（上）》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>42级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、金纺线、夜莺银哨、装备、肩饰、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Being with you makes us the \"best partners.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the side story \"Dreams Come True (Part 1)\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>42</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Nightingale Silver Whistle, Equipment, Shoulder Accessory, Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【鸦语】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得鸦语套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crow Talk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Crow Talk outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>圣者之布·日光镶边·垂坠圣甲\n至诚至纯的灵魂，将如日光般神圣，赤心颂唱时，太阳也为你首肯。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Saint's Cloth · Sunlight Edging · Draping Holy Armor \n A soul that is sincere and pure will be as sacred as sunlight; when you chant with a red heart, the Sun will also nod for you.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在趣斗玩法中跻身全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide in the Fun Fight mode. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {恐惧主教} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {Bishop of Fear} entry",
    ["Thank you, {{先生|女士}}. This is just my story; perhaps other knights will experience even more magnificent adventures."] = "Thank you, {{Sir|Madam}}. This is just my story; perhaps other knights will experience even more magnificent adventures.",
    ["【62】日子满足"] = "【62】Day Satisfaction",
    ["【任务NPC】乔治-喷泉"] = "[Quest NPC] George - Fountain",
    ["一枚精致的徽章，这是老托马斯为他视为家人的孩子打造的护身符。他曾说：\"再好的工艺品也会磨损，但守护的意愿不会。\""] = "An exquisite badge, an amulet crafted by Old Thomas for the children he considers family. He once said: \"Even the best craftsmanship will wear out, but the will to guard will not.\"",
    ["不过非要说的话，我喜欢观察植物生长。看着一颗种子从土里钻出来，慢慢长高，长出叶子，开花结果——这个过程太美妙了。"] = "But if I had to say, I like observing plants grow. Watching a seed sprout from the soil, slowly grow taller, sprout leaves, bloom, and bear fruit—this process is simply wonderful.",
