    ["使用后获得<Highlight>铁道旅人发型</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight>Railway Traveler Hairstyle</>",
    ["使用特制星象盘作为星轨投影的专属承载体，引动星界星轨的真实投影落于盘上。通过观测星轨顺行、逆行、交汇、隐现的变化，解读其映射的现实空间异动、事态发展走向与潜在未知危险。\n占星启示期间，周围的玩家可以获得临时技能来获取占星指引。\n使自身获得武力加4，直觉加2。使用临时技能获取占星指引的玩家也可以获得武力加4，直觉加2。"] = "Use a special astrolabe as a dedicated carrier for astral projections, channeling the true projection of the astral world's star tracks onto the plate. By observing the changes in the star tracks—their forward motion, retrograde, intersection, and appearance/disappearance—interpret the mapped spatial anomalies, the development of events, and potential unknown dangers. \nDuring Astrological Revelation, surrounding players can obtain temporary skills to receive astrological guidance.\n Increases your Might by 4 and Intuition by 2. Players who use the temporary skill to obtain astrological guidance also gain Might +4 and Intuition +2.",
